{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44039","headline":"古意 · 崔萱","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灼灼叶中花，夏萎春又芳。\n明明天上月，蟾缺圆复光。\n未如君子情，朝违夕已忘。\n玉帐枕犹暖，纨扇思何长。\n愿因西南风，吹上玳瑁牀。\n娇眠锦衾里，展转双鸳鸯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔萱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}